@UsersApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@UserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Obtener todos los usuarios
GET {{UsersApi_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Crear usuario
POST {{UsersApi_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Torres",
  "email": "ana@example.com"
}

### Obtener usuario por ID
GET {{UsersApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar usuario
PUT {{UsersApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Torres Vargas",
  "email": "ana.torres@example.com"
}

### Eliminar usuario
DELETE {{UsersApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}
